"formátumban."

#: pro/config/documents/ca/privacy-policy.php:125
msgctxt "Legal document privacy statement"
msgid ""
"You may request correction or deletion of the data if it is incorrect or not"
" or no longer relevant. Where appropriate, the amended information shall be "
"transmitted to third parties having access to the information in question."
msgstr ""
