"teszünk, kivéve, ha az adatkezelésnek jogos indokai vannak."

#: pro/config/documents/eu/privacy-policy.php:170
msgctxt "Legal document privacy statement"
msgid ""
"We make decisions on the basis of automated processing with respect to "
"matters that may have (significant) consequences for individuals. These are "
"decisions taken by computer programs or systems without human intervention."
msgstr ""
